1
00:00:00,247 --> 00:00:05,611
When Orion moved behind the Moon, the crew
knew radio contact with Earth would drop.

2
00:00:05,994 --> 00:00:08,548
The Moon itself blocked the direct path.

3
00:00:08,989 --> 00:00:12,925
For a while, the people aboard Orion
could keep watching and recording,

4
00:00:13,134 --> 00:00:16,814
while people on the ground
had to wait for contact to return.

5
00:00:17,418 --> 00:00:21,005
This was a rare chance to watch
the dark lunar surface.
